					"nextDialogs": [
						750870303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奥伯龙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750870303,
					"content": "难道…难道是奥伯龙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750870304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750870304,
					"content": "啊呜！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750870305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奥伯龙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750870305,
					"content": "呃，一会儿不见，你成长了很多呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750870306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750870306,
					"content": "塔卢加说它容易发胖，真的一点不假。对了，他人呢？怎么没和你在一起？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750870307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750870307,
					"content": "呜…呜呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750870308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奥伯龙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750870308,
					"content": "唔，总之先带它离开这里吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750870309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750870309,
					"content": "说起来，反正已经找到奥伯龙了，我们也不用东躲西藏了吧？塔卢加的下落也很叫人担心…得快些才行！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
